      "content": "wait acamprosate?? i've never even heard of that i dont want to take random meds i dont know about. honestly i'm just really desperate right now and i feel like i can't even stand up. can you just tell me if a single dose of advil is actually dangerous or if you're just being extra cautious? i just want to know if it's safe or not.",
